        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091370/extras/9c7523a5ad483ee56e43f361a13c541a.avif?t=1773004643\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes Hooray Survivors</strong> is a fast-paced auto-shooter where you create a party of three heroes and try to survive 15 minute runs. Unlock new heroes and game modes, slay enemies and gain souls which can be used to make heroes stronger, improve party stats or gain new levels of abilities and thus make each run a bit more easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero can have only three skills per run - so choose your abilities carefully! Once a hero has acquired three skills, the ultimate skill is unlocked for that hero which has longer cooldown than regular skills, but is much more powerful and devastating and can help you survive tough situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you collect Fragments of Power or survive in the Favor arenas for long enough - you will be able to boost your party or hero stats and make it easier to survive and defeat powerful bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three game modes are available:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Survival</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive for 15 minutes and defeat the boss</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ritual</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek out randomly placed seals and destroy them to weaken the beast and defeat it</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>High Score</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay many monsters  and survive for as long as you can and earn your spot in the global leaderboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80 unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 ultimate abilities that can be used automatically or manually</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 game modes: Survival, Ritual and High Score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 minute runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091370/extras/9c7523a5ad483ee56e43f361a13c541a.avif?t=1773004643\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes Hooray Survivors</strong> is a fast-paced auto-shooter where you create a party of three heroes and try to survive 15 minute runs. Unlock new heroes and game modes, slay enemies and gain souls which can be used to make heroes stronger, improve party stats or gain new levels of abilities and thus make each run a bit more easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero can have only three skills per run - so choose your abilities carefully! Once a hero has acquired three skills, the ultimate skill is unlocked for that hero which has longer cooldown than regular skills, but is much more powerful and devastating and can help you survive tough situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you collect Fragments of Power or survive in the Favor arenas for long enough - you will be able to boost your party or hero stats and make it easier to survive and defeat powerful bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three game modes are available:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Survival</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive for 15 minutes and defeat the boss</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ritual</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek out randomly placed seals and destroy them to weaken the beast and defeat it</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>High Score</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay many monsters  and survive for as long as you can and earn your spot in the global leaderboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80 unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 ultimate abilities that can be used automatically or manually</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 game modes: Survival, Ritual and High Score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 minute runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Assemble your hero party, slay monsters and survive! In Heroes Hooray Survivors you will create a party of three heroes and try to survive waves of monsters and defeat bosses. Total of 16 heroes provides great variety of party builds - discover different synergies they can form.",
